# Tests

- Use `unittest.TestCase` in `tests/test_*.py`. Do not add pytest unless asked.
- Name tests after the behavior, not the implementation (`test_wider_beam_recovers_higher_scoring_dog_ran`).
- Assert observable outputs (`format_tokens(...)`, log-probs) rather than private helpers.
- When changing search or a toy model, extend the existing class in `tests/test_search.py` instead of creating a parallel suite.
- Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` before considering the change done.
